# One variable, and the shrinking is the point.
#
# This file used to carry both agents' tokens, both service names and the locale, because this
# server called the agents itself and decided what to ask them. The gateway runs the flow now:
# it holds the tokens, it names the services, it picks the language. Everything that used to
# be configured here is configured there, under GATEWAY_ORCHESTRATION__*.
#
# Where the CodeZard gateway lives, as seen from THIS server (never from the browser).
#
#   http://127.0.0.1:8000   the gateway run natively (`gateway`, in CodeZard) — the default here
#   http://127.0.0.1:8090   the gateway from CodeZard's docker-compose.local.yml
#   http://gateway:8000     this app itself running inside a Docker network (the built-in
#                           fallback when nothing is set, and unreachable from a plain terminal)
#
# `npm run dev` reads this file. The built server (`npm run preview`) does NOT: it only reads
# real environment variables, so it needs GATEWAY_URL exported. See the README.
GATEWAY_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
